  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 916ca174c9f91bc47ab29cda8fbdcf0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memory_books
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MemoryData
  openingLine: This reminds me of...
  lines:
  - My mom used to read me these books at bedtime, every night...
  - "I\u2019d cry every time the big bad wolf showed up. He scared me so much."
  - But she always told me she was right next to me.
  - She promised to stay with me until I fell asleep.
  - I never really did fall asleep at bedtime stories.
  - I miss her so much.
